=Task ID: {{ $json.taskId }}

Run on your machine:
  node scripts/run-stage2-cli.mjs --task-id "{{ $json.taskId }}" --webhook-url "<your Stage 2 webhook URL>" --plan-file <path-to-plan.json>

The script invokes the real Claude Code CLI headlessly, validates/tests the generated files, and POSTs the result to the Stage 2 webhook below, which will validate again and either commit to GitHub or file a failure issue.

Plan JSON (save this to a file for the script):
{{ JSON.stringify($json.plan) }}

